-- booking_28_descriptions (17.10.2026): tuotekuvaukset kb 8, 10, 11, 12 (kb.products.description / description_en). Vain tekstit; Joonas käy tekstit läpi myöhemmin.
-- kb 8: FI/EN vastaamaan itsenäistä varausta (alkaa 16:00/16:30/17:00, ei vaadi muuta varausta). kb 10–12: EN-kuvaukset lisätty (FI-tekstit tarkistettu: henkilömäärät 1–4/1–2/1–2, kestot 1/2/3 h ok). Vanhat arvot: booking_28_descriptions_ROLLBACK.sql
update kb.products set description = $t8on$Lyhyt saunotusrituaali hoitosauna Raunissa (enintään kuusi henkeä kerrallaan): löylyntervehdys, kevyttä lämmittelyvihdontaa ja vuodenkierron mukainen minihoito. Kesto 20 minuuttia; rituaali alkaa klo 16.00, 16.30 tai 17.00. Rituaalin voi varata yksinään – se ei vaadi muuta varausta. Voi osallistua uimapuvussa tai alasti.$t8on$, description_en = $t8en$A short sauna ritual in the Rauni healing sauna (up to six guests at a time): a greeting of the steam (löyly), gentle warming with birch whisks and a mini treatment that follows the turning of the seasons. Duration 20 minutes; the ritual starts at 16:00, 16:30 or 17:00. The ritual can be booked on its own – no other booking is required. You may take part in swimwear or nude.$t8en$ where id = 8;
update kb.products set description_en = $t10en$A gentle yet deep pause with löyly (steam), warmth and natural ingredients. The treatment begins with a steam greeting ritual, after which your sauna therapist performs the treatment of your choice: honey, birch whisk, salt or peat treatment (chosen at checkout). Available for 1–4 guests; the content adapts to the size of the group. The price does not include entrance to the smoke sauna or hot tubs (tickets are sold separately). Held in the Rauni healing sauna. Sauna therapists: Laura Foon, Joonas Vaarala and Saara Mäntykoski. You may take part nude, partly or fully in swimwear.$t10en$ where id = 10;
update kb.products set description_en = $t11en$A two-hour, all-round sauna experience: birch whisks, plants, herbs, salt and honey, and optionally a peat treatment; incantations, whisking, techniques with löyly (steam), water and air, a float in a cool pool and herbal tea. The therapist adapts the intensity to you. Available for 1–2 guests. The price does not include entrance to the smoke sauna or hot tubs (tickets are sold separately). Held in the Rauni healing sauna. Sauna therapists: Laura Foon, Joonas Vaarala and Saara Mäntykoski. You may take part nude, partly or fully in swimwear.$t11en$ where id = 11;
update kb.products set description_en = $t12en$A three-hour, multi-stage sauna ritual: birch whisks, plants, herbs, salt, honey and optionally peat; incantations, rhythmic whisking, alternating warm and cool, and a float in a cool pool. Includes herbal tea and a light snack. Available for 1–2 guests. The price does not include entrance to the smoke sauna or hot tubs (tickets are sold separately). Held in the Rauni healing sauna. Sauna therapists: Laura Foon, Joonas Vaarala and Saara Mäntykoski. You may take part nude, partly or fully in swimwear.$t12en$ where id = 12;
